# Static self-signed test fixture, deliberately signed by nobody the proxy
# trusts: only test-server-inspect/cert.pem is passed in through
# BUILDCAGE_EXTRA_CA_FILE. It names impostor.example.com so the only thing
# wrong with it is who signed it. Regenerate with:
#   openssl req -x509 -newkey rsa:2048 -nodes \
#     -keyout key.pem -out cert.pem -days 3650 \
#     -subj "/CN=impostor" \
#     -addext "subjectAltName=DNS:impostor,DNS:impostor.example.com"
